  "description": "Golden digest vectors for amq.remote.command/1. Each vector is a complete command and its expected input_digest (sha256 hex with sha256: prefix). Vectors sharing an equivalence_group MUST produce the same digest \u2014 they differ only in a spelling axis that the digest must normalize. A Go test asserts CommandDigest reproduces each; a foreign carrier runs the same vectors to prove it agrees. B10: not_after is NOT in the digest (a deadline is policy, not identity); the not-after group now asserts that different deadlines produce the same digest.",
